## Reproduce
```bash
OODAC=/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/oodac/oodac
# stmt println (token rail) + eprintln (walker rail)
$OODAC emit-c /tmp/tmp.NqFdt1YR5S/s71_1_println_bare.oo    # ERR secret api_key
$OODAC emit-c /tmp/tmp.NqFdt1YR5S/s71_3_eprintln_bare.oo   # ERR secret api_key
# escape then unquoted SECRET (walker)
$OODAC emit-c /tmp/tmp.NqFdt1YR5S/s71_6_eprint_quote.oo    # ERR secret api_key
$OODAC emit-c /tmp/tmp.NqFdt1YR5S/s71_5_eprint_bs.oo       # ERR secret api_key
# no FP
$OODAC emit-c /tmp/tmp.NqFdt1YR5S/s71_4_println_str_fp.oo  # rc=0
# floor
$OODAC emit-c ooda/fixtures/secret_sink_fail.oo
$OODAC emit-c ooda/fixtures/secret_eprintln_fail.oo
bash ooda/scripts/s71_guard_scan_smoke.oo                  # exit 0
```

